ndisclosed number of years.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"The news has sent shockwaves through the historical community, with many questioning how this could be possible, given the significant gap in their lifetimes.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"\\\"I'm still trying to wrap my head around it,\\\" said Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"Emily Wilson, a renowned historian specializing in 19th-century British history.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"\\\"The idea that Marion Jessie Thompson, a woman born in the late 19th century, could be married to someone who died decades before her birth is simply mind-boggling.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"When approached for comment, Marion Jessie Thompson remained tight-lipped about the details of her marriage, citing \\\"personal reasons\\\" for her reluctance to discuss the matter further.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"However, in a brief statement, she expressed her gratitude for the love and support of her husband, Ruby Frewen.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"\\\"I'm just grateful to have found love, no matter the circumstances,\\\" Thompson said, her voice trembling with emotion.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"\\\"Ruby has been my rock, my partner, and my best friend.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"I couldn't imagine living without him.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"While the exact nature of their relationship remains unclear, experts point to a series of cryptic letters and diaries discovered in Thompson's possession, which appear to suggest a deep emotional connection between the two.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"\\\"The language used in these letters is incredibly intimate,\\\" said Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"James Reed, a leading expert in historical correspondence.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"\\\"It's clear that Marion Jessie Thompson and Ruby Frewen shared a profound bond, one that transcended time and space.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"As news of the marriage continues to spread, the public remains fascinated by the enigmatic couple.\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"While some have raised questions about the legitimacy of the union, others have praised the couple's love as a testament to the power of human connection.\"}]}"
